                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5ef2d8d-cddd-4daf-839c-036360c36769",
                                                "sense_id": "736f44da-a520-37db-84d4-193a7348b209",
                                                "text": "When I had sown the field, the day's work was over."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                        "entry_id": "4e34b0d3-2de5-386d-a076-2e4dd1e23dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spread abroad; to propagate. (usu. negative connotation)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c50766e2-ed75-4bcb-ba6b-e7e46603ba54",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                                "text": "As you sow, so shall you reap."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1c080ad-deab-4b69-b938-6ea9f6fd4d2b",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                                "text": "Euen as I haue seene, they that plow iniquity, and sow wickednsse, reape the same."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48064cf1-68b9-4e15-89a8-31132d89eeaf",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                                "text": "And sow dissension in the hearts of brothers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0859066-74cf-43fe-9246-9996fdecf5ba",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                                "text": "Not surprisingly, it has sown doubt among other operators of diesel-hydraulics; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce8b527-ad7f-4668-9b6d-828a5d193f9b",
                                                "sense_id": "3ef5b07c-4c40-3588-b008-dd8dc56e06f3",
                                                "text": "‘Laying claim to nature’s work’: plant patents sow fear among small growers [title]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77747ba2-b29b-3e84-839f-25d8a2b69e40",
                                        "entry_id": "4e34b0d3-2de5-386d-a076-2e4dd1e23dac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To scatter over; to besprinkle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d2087d3-0751-4852-abd9-753c88aaa83d",
                                                "sense_id": "77747ba2-b29b-3e84-839f-25d8a2b69e40",
                                                "text": "The intellectual faculty is a goodly field, […] and it is the worst husbandry in the world to sow it with trifles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9e6015a-19f4-4404-9487-b67138c10ae1",
                                                "sense_id": "77747ba2-b29b-3e84-839f-25d8a2b69e40",
                                                "text": "[He] sowd with Starrs the heav'n."
